  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (e.g., config_024) achieve high accuracy. This experiment tests config_022, which uses scvi_n200 and resnet50 image encoder with transformer aggregation and concat fusion. It clarifies whether switching the image encoder to resnet50 (which is less expensive) and changing the fusion method could maintain high accuracy while reducing cost. This balances exploitation of current top performers with exploration of cost-effective alternatives."
